{"id":"re_ussite","lemma":"réussite","pos":"noun","rank":3010,"glosses":["success","patience card game, solitaire"],"ipa":"/ʁe.y.sit/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-r%C3%A9ussite.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-r%C3%A9ussite.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"réussites"},"formAudio":{"réussites":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-r%C3%A9ussites.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ce sera une grande réussite.","en":"That'll be a big achievement.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Je dois ma réussite à mes amis.","en":"I owe my success to my friends.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"friend","l":"ami"}]},{"text":"Nous voulons que ce soit une réussite.","en":"We want it to be successful.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"let be"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"J'étais content d'apprendre ta réussite.","en":"I was glad to hear of your success.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/2307","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"content"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to learn"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"C'est une énorme réussite.","en":"That's a huge achievement.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"enormous, huge"},null]}]}